{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16207660","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16207660","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1620766001:0":{"text":"More and more students arrive. The party officially begins...","source_cn":"到场的学生越来越多。不久之后，派对正式开始——<key...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12B458E5D2683E67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620766002:1":{"text":"Welcome, students, to the chaos magic party!","source_cn":"欢迎大家来到混沌魔法派对的现场！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15580F13680C55DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620766003:1":{"text":"Professor Solise?!","source_cn":"娑丽丝老师？！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C114048EDAA1F48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620766004:1":{"text":"Did you organize all of this, Professor?","source_cn":"难道说派对的组织者竟然是娑丽丝老师？<key:dial...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D5416E99AF8ECA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620766005:1":{"text":"I'm sure many of you have been speculating about who organized this party. Now, I'd like to invite the organizer to say a few words.","source_cn":"想必大家对于派对的组织者一定有许多猜测吧，下面，我就邀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0DABDB82481857C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1620766006:1":{"text":"Pippa slowly walks to the center of the room.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2638567FC096BA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620766007:1":{"text":"Hey everyone! I'm Pippa, the creator of chaos magic. Hard to believe, right?","source_cn":"大家好！我是皮帕，也是混沌魔法的发明者。没错，就是我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0D41B76F83475C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620766008:1":{"text":"When I used magic myself, it never really listened to me, and somehow I accidentally created chaos magic. Then I shared it with everyone just for kicks.","source_cn":"我自己使用魔法的时候效果很不稳定，结果误打误撞发明了混...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x916B1D77644B1AD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620766009:1":{"text":"I never expected it to get this popular. Thank you all for loving my magic.","source_cn":"我没想到它会变得这么流行，收获这么多的喜爱，非常感谢大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBDFBD1C5A111BAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620766010:1":{"text":"We should be thanking you, Pippa!","source_cn":"别客气皮帕，是我们要谢谢你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A801646FCB86D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620766011:1":{"text":"Thanks to your magic, I was able to meet Professor Bergman.","source_cn":"多亏了你的魔法，我才能见到柏格曼老师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x945001246AC8D098","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1620766012:1":{"text":"But seeing it get more popular makes me worried... The magic's random effects can be fun, sure, but they can also be dangerous. It may put all of you at risk.","source_cn":"不过，看到它越来越流行，我也越来越担忧，魔法效果完全随...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BA5EDEC2642AEBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1620766013:1":{"text":"So starting today on, I'm having Magister Merlin put limits on it. Chaos magic won't be usable anywhere on campus.","source_cn":"所以今天之后，我会请梅林大人施加限制术法，以后混沌魔法...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x27B224734A459A0D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So starting today on, I'm having Magister Merlin put limits on it. Chaos magic won't be usable anywhere on campus.","female":"So starting today on, I'm having Magister Merlin put limits on it. Chaos magic won't be usable anywhere on campus.","variant_male_record_index":"202638","variant_female_record_index":"202639","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1620766014:1":{"text":"No! We haven't had our fun yet!","source_cn":"别啊！大家都还没玩够呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA64E5CAB938B70A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1620766015:1":{"text":"That came out of nowhere!","source_cn":"这太突然了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB602AE24A8E5B708","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1620766016:1":{"text":"Is there no other way?","source_cn":"没有其他办法了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8FA257DCFB856C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1620766016":{"text":"Is there no other way?","source_cn":"没有其他办法了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8FA257DCFB856C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1620766017:1":{"text":"I'm sorry, everyone... I know it's a bit selfish to both invent this magic and be the one to ban it. I can see why you're upset.","source_cn":"抱歉大家……我知道由我亲自发明的魔法，又由我亲自来禁止...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA5BF44D63501BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1620766018:1":{"text":"But just today, chaos magic turned someone into a book page, trapped someone in a painting, and a weird potion did weird things to people! The consequences were bad.","source_cn":"但是仅仅在今天，因为混沌魔法，有人被变成了书页，有人被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87178EC5BB77B947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1620766019:1":{"text":"I'm the one indirectly causing all this trouble... For everyone's safety, I must take responsibility. The best solution I can think of is to ban chaos magic.","source_cn":"这些危机都是由我间接造成的……为了大家的安全，我必须承...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0875CDACDD06EC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1620766020:1":{"text":"So for tonight, let's make the most of the first and final chaos magic party! Let chaos reign!","source_cn":"今天晚上，希望大家能享受最初也是最后的混沌魔法派对，尽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E9DEB66F2A6A7EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1620766021:1":{"text":"I'm sorry, Pippa. I should've tried harder to see things from your point of view.","source_cn":"对不起皮帕，我应该站在你的角度多想想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3224D8575591E184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1620766022:1":{"text":"We understand your decision.","source_cn":"皮帕，我理解你的决定！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB4DE6E00A335222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1620766023:1":{"text":"This is the last time, everyone! Let's go all out and have a blast!","source_cn":"最后一次了，大家一起痛痛快快地玩一场吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3447268FC83528A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"Everyone, calm down.","source_cn":"诸位不要激动","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x73D3DFAF93F9B871","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Everyone, calm down.","female":"Everyone, calm down.","variant_male_record_index":"82691","variant_female_record_index":"82692","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:1:2":{"text":"Please listen to Pippa.","source_cn":"耐心听听皮帕的想法吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6ABCF0FBE99470CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Please listen to Pippa.","female":"Please listen to Pippa.","variant_male_record_index":"82693","variant_female_record_index":"82694","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"Black Screen","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:娑丽丝":{"text":"Solise","source":"娑丽丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布里奇特":{"text":"Bridger","source":"布里奇特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨迪":{"text":"Sadie","source":"萨迪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"Pippa","source":"皮帕